      "confirmed_status": "Current F2 still lacks an explicit alpha<0 condition on its trailing scaled-eigenpair clause; exact supplier clause(c) expressly includes that condition. The existing attractive-coupling proof invokes it only after g<0 implies alpha_g<0.",
